-- Each repository names its Roc version in a `roc-version` file, and a Roc
-- recipe that runs the compiler finds that version's `roc` (its `roc_bin!`).
-- The version matters because `roc fmt`'s layout and the compiler's method
-- lookup change from one nightly to the next. This library names the one a
-- self-test runs: the goldens' scripts load it, and the Roc recipes read
-- `SELF_TEST_PIN` from this file's text.

-- Every recipe's self-test runs this Roc. CI installs it from roc-apps's release.
const SELF_TEST_PIN = "0.1.0_RC1"
